00:32:56.760 --> 00:32:58.120
Comrade Peng Tao is right.

00:32:58.640 --> 00:33:01.400
Fight and love can be equal.

00:33:01.880 --> 00:33:03.520
The more important it is,

00:33:04.400 --> 00:33:06.800
the more I think the time I spend with you is precious.

00:33:15.720 --> 00:33:16.960
Listen, Cai.

00:33:17.680 --> 00:33:20.880
I will marry you in my life.

00:33:21.440 --> 00:33:23.520
Whether you're alive or dead,

00:33:23.880 --> 00:33:24.760
or disabled,

00:33:26.400 --> 00:33:28.200
Nothing can separate us.

00:34:04.280 --> 00:34:05.200
Look at this road.

00:34:05.400 --> 00:34:06.240
Does it look like the road

00:34:06.480 --> 00:34:08.040
when we were young?

00:34:09.840 --> 00:34:10.920
At that time, the three of us...

00:34:11.199 --> 00:34:12.360
You, me, Bao.

00:34:12.960 --> 00:34:14.120
So naughty.

00:34:15.480 --> 00:34:18.880
He always comes out at night

00:34:19.159 --> 00:34:20.040
in the pool

00:34:20.280 --> 00:34:21.360
and catch their frogs.

00:34:21.360 --> 00:34:22.400
and catch fireflies.

00:34:22.400 --> 00:34:23.600
and eat other people's food.

00:34:23.600 --> 00:34:25.239
and do something unreasonable.

00:34:25.760 --> 00:34:28.600
Father will beat us when he catches us.

00:34:32.440 --> 00:34:35.480
Twenty years have passed.

00:34:37.040 --> 00:34:38.840
I don't know what home is like.

00:34:41.280 --> 00:34:42.679
After we defeat the kids,

00:34:43.040 --> 00:34:45.320
we’ll go back to Peking together.

00:34:46.280 --> 00:34:47.920
Then we can sort out

00:34:47.920 --> 00:34:49.080
the abandoned yard

00:34:49.800 --> 00:34:52.560
and add new soil to my father's grave.

00:34:53.520 --> 00:34:54.440
When we go back,

00:34:54.440 --> 00:34:55.920
if we go back.

