00:35:19.440 --> 00:35:21.640
We've never confessed our feelings.

00:35:22.120 --> 00:35:23.920
How would I know?

00:35:27.120 --> 00:35:28.400
You're blushing.

00:35:30.120 --> 00:35:31.560
Why should I confess?

00:35:31.840 --> 00:35:32.800
Lower your voice.

00:35:33.080 --> 00:35:34.720
You're following me around every day.

00:35:34.960 --> 00:35:36.600
It's almost on the bottom.

